{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-based-optimizer","title":"基于代价的优化器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/cost-based-optimizer","wordCount":1585,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于代价的优化器\">基于代价的优化器</h1><p>当一个变换的好坏取决于数据——比如三张表先连哪两张更省——规则就无能为力了，必须把候选方案一个个枚举出来、用代价模型逐个打分、挑最便宜的。这就是基于代价的优化（cost-based optimization, CBO），现代关系型数据库优化器的主体。它的难点不在打分（那是代价模型的事），而在「候选方案太多」：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 张表的连接顺序数量阶乘式爆炸，不可能全试。如何在这个天文数字的搜索空间里高效找到接近最优的计划，是这一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代价优化是一个「枚举—打分—择优」的搜索过程，它建立在 <a href=\"../foundations/cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a> 提供的打分函数和 <a href=\"statistics-histograms\">统计信息与直方图</a> 提供的数据分布之上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[逻辑计划&lt;br/&gt;已经过规则重写] --&gt; B[枚举候选物理计划]&#10;    B --&gt; C[连接顺序的不同组合]&#10;    B --&gt; D[每个连接的算法选择]&#10;    B --&gt; E[每张表的访问路径]&#10;    C --&gt; F[用代价模型打分]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{搜索策略}&#10;    G --&gt; H[动态规划 System R]&#10;    G --&gt; I[遗传/启发式 geqo]&#10;    H --&gt; J[选总代价最低的计划]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[逻辑计划&lt;br/&gt;已经过规则重写] --&gt; B[枚举候选物理计划]\n    B --&gt; C[连接顺序的不同组合]\n    B --&gt; D[每个连接的算法选择]\n    B --&gt; E[每张表的访问路径]\n    C --&gt; F[用代价模型打分]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{搜索策略}\n    G --&gt; H[动态规划 System R]\n    G --&gt; I[遗传/启发式 geqo]\n    H --&gt; J[选总代价最低的计划]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>下表对比主流搜索策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>最优性</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>穷举</td>\n<td>极小（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 表）</td>\n<td>全局最优</td>\n<td>阶乘爆炸</td>\n<td>教学用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划</td>\n<td>中（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 10\\sim12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 表）</td>\n<td>全局最优</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(3^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>System R / PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗传算法</td>\n<td>大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 表）</td>\n<td>近似最优</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL geqo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习型</td>\n<td>实验/前沿</td>\n<td>经验最优</td>\n<td>训练开销</td>\n<td>Neo 等研究系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"搜索空间为何爆炸\">搜索空间为何爆炸</h2><p>问题的核心是连接顺序。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 张表做连接，光是连接的二叉树形态（结合方式）就有卡特兰数那么多，再叠加每棵树左右子树的排列，左深树（left-deep tree）的顺序数就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n!</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>362</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>8800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10! = 362\\,8800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">362</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8800</span></span></span></span></span>，再乘上每个连接 <a href=\"../access-methods/join-algorithms\">连接算法</a> 的三种算法选择和每张表 <a href=\"../access-methods/scan-methods\">扫描与访问路径</a> 的若干访问路径，总候选数轻松上亿。逐一打分不现实。</p>\n<p>更麻烦的是，连接顺序的优劣极其敏感于中间结果大小，而中间结果大小又靠基数估计——一旦估歪，搜出来的「最优」其实最差。所以代价优化的成败，一半在搜索算法，一半在统计质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"system-r-的动态规划\">System R 的动态规划</h2><p>1979 年 IBM System R 提出的动态规划至今仍是主流。它的关键洞察是最优子结构：要找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{A, B, C, D\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 四表连接的最优计划，可以先求出所有三表子集（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{A,B,C\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{A,B,D\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 等）的最优计划，再在它们基础上各加一张表。这样按子集大小从小到大递推，每个子集的最优解只算一次、存起来复用，避免了重复计算。</p>\n<p>它的复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(3^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n!</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span></span> 好得多，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 时仍可接受。System R 还有一个影响深远的细节：它在记录每个子集的最优计划时，不只记「最便宜的」，还为每种有价值的物理有序性（interesting order，如某列已排好序）各保留一个最优计划。因为一个略贵但已排序的中间结果，可能让上层的排序合并连接（见 <a href=\"../access-methods/join-algorithms\">连接算法</a>）或 <code>ORDER BY</code> 省掉排序，全局反而更优。这种「带物理属性的动态规划」是现代优化器的标配。其递推可以用伪代码概括：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"for size in 1..n:                      # 按子集大小递增&#10;  for each subset S of tables, |S|==size:&#10;    for each split S = L ∪ R:          # 枚举拆法&#10;      plan = bestPlan(L) ⋈ bestPlan(R) # 复用子集最优解&#10;      if cost(plan) &lt; best[S]:         # 含 interesting order 时分别记&#10;        best[S] = plan&#10;return best[{all tables}]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>for size in 1..n:                      # 按子集大小递增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for each subset S of tables, |S|==size:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for each split S = L ∪ R:          # 枚举拆法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      plan = bestPlan(L) ⋈ bestPlan(R) # 复用子集最优解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if cost(plan) &#x3C; best[S]:         # 含 interesting order 时分别记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        best[S] = plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return best[{all tables}]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"启发式与遗传算法-应对大连接\">启发式与遗传算法：应对大连接</h2><p>当表数量超过动态规划能承受的范围（PostgreSQL 默认 <code>geqo_threshold = 12</code>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(3^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 也撑不住了，必须退而求其次。PostgreSQL 的做法是 geqo（genetic query optimizer，遗传查询优化器）：把一个连接顺序编码成「染色体」，用遗传算法的选择、交叉、变异在解空间里演化若干代，挑出适应度（即代价倒数）最高的。它不保证全局最优，但能在合理时间内给出足够好的解。</p>\n<p>其他系统有别的招：贪心地每次选当前代价最小的连接、限制只搜左深树以缩小空间、或用规则把搜索引导到大概率好的区域。这些都是在「搜索质量」和「优化耗时」之间的工程权衡——回到 <a href=\"../foundations/query-lifecycle\">查询生命周期与处理流程</a> 里那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>optimize</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>execute</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{optimize}} + T_{\\text{execute}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">optimize</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">execute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的总账：对一条 20 表的报表查询，多花一秒优化换执行快十倍值得；对一条 OLTP 点查，优化本身就得快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习型优化器的前沿\">学习型优化器的前沿</h2><p>经典 CBO 的阿喀琉斯之踵始终是基数估计误差。近年学界转向用机器学习直接介入这个环节甚至整个优化过程。一类是学习型基数估计，用深度模型（如 NeuroCard、基于深度学习的 MSCN）学习数据的联合分布，比传统直方图更能捕捉列间相关性；2026 年的 SIGMOD 等会议仍有 CorrBound 这类专门处理列间与列内相关性的新工作。另一类更激进，用强化学习直接学连接顺序（把优化建模成序列决策问题），或像 Neo 那样用深度学习端到端生成整份计划。</p>\n<p>这些方法在基准上常优于传统优化器，但落地仍有障碍：模型需要训练数据和重训成本，数据删除后模型如何更新（2026 年仍是开放问题），以及可解释性和稳定性的担忧——线上系统更怕「偶尔出个灾难计划」而非「平均慢一点」。所以截至 2026 年，主流生产数据库仍以经过几十年打磨的动态规划 + 直方图为基石，学习型方法多作为辅助或处于实验阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代价优化是「枚举候选—代价打分—择优」的搜索，处理规则解决不了的数据相关选择，核心难点是连接顺序的阶乘爆炸。</li>\n<li>搜索空间同时受连接顺序、连接算法、访问路径三个维度相乘而膨胀，且优劣极度敏感于基数估计。</li>\n<li>System R 动态规划用最优子结构把复杂度降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(3^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并为每种有价值的物理有序性各留一个最优解。</li>\n<li>表数过多时退化为 geqo 遗传算法或贪心/左深树启发式，是搜索质量与优化耗时的工程权衡。</li>\n<li>学习型基数估计与强化学习连接排序是前沿方向，2026 年仍有新研究，但训练成本、更新难题与稳定性使主流生产库仍以经典方法为基石。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于代价的优化器","id":"基于代价的优化器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"搜索空间为何爆炸","id":"搜索空间为何爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"System R 的动态规划","id":"system-r-的动态规划"},{"level":2,"text":"启发式与遗传算法：应对大连接","id":"启发式与遗传算法-应对大连接"},{"level":2,"text":"学习型优化器的前沿","id":"学习型优化器的前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于规则的查询重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/rule-based-rewrite"},"next":{"title":"统计信息与直方图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/statistics-histograms"}}